{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportDisagreeTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportDisagreeTitle", "text": "The phone and the band disagree", "sha256": "fd5f3c4339e1ff150d387bdc462a11e4d23e2b0d63af9e8b38cc17a8d404807d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportAgreeTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportAgreeTitle", "text": "The phone and the band agree", "sha256": "0c3e184384e8bcaf70e0cb570c9e155fd3952577cbf0a754cbace0ba7eec0210", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportHigher", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportHigher", "text": "higher", "sha256": "e5ff8d2b6809d8105d3c75b2f8c4a77d4c73d39e11fddc02605720a13168de48", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportLower", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportLower", "text": "lower", "sha256": "8c6fb1e9e37a1aea1d308c785192e1a17d71cef08c7f50a68d2e0ab292b2e7f4", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportDisagreeBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportDisagreeBody", "text": "{store} puts your resting heart rate {delta} bpm {dir} than this band measures it over {nights} nights. They are not describing the same thing, so it stays unused.", "sha256": "8c3783964839be371325f70afe681ad2b186e364c238946ae2616390110933e0", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportAgreeBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportAgreeBody", "text": "Over {nights} nights the band lands within {delta} bpm of what {store} said. It still is not used for anything.", "sha256": "bf1bcef219c0e0b315855dece5925cba0b37bbf4b24f7608de7beec88b6cdc10", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportMeasuredElsewhere", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportMeasuredElsewhere", "text": "Measured by something else", "sha256": "98427ab2fb00498758c97fc07e494db81cb1a0e0e7689ac38f47d1501a203500", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportMeasuredElsewhereBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportMeasuredElsewhereBody", "text": "A cuff, a glucose meter, a thermometer. This band cannot measure any of them, which is the entire reason they are worth showing — and why the app that recorded each reading is named beside it.", "sha256": "d137137ef718bd4269ff7e76ec0ac6691821323c3e9bca1dd800b8b7e2510143", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportNeverAveraged", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportNeverAveraged", "text": "Shown as they arrived. Never averaged into one of this app’s own numbers, never used to teach it to guess one from the wrist.", "sha256": "3ca0c9285fdbe9bc9f397ca62d94924a7865758838530e7daa1487fdd727c024", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportReadFrom", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportReadFrom", "text": "Read from {store}", "sha256": "e895a587cbd8b51df6ada3c530fab5f795a74a088b8c1fa3b2edb2e248d993db", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportMovedTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportMovedTitle", "text": "Height, weight and workouts moved", "sha256": "8579dc2f3448aac3f0c32d13055d68b50fd8cfa5eef43831f18e9190ab7fe2d0", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportMovedBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportMovedBody", "text": "Height and weight are on Edit profile now, and workouts this phone recorded are on Workout, under History. Each one sits on the screen it fills.", "sha256": "8e131421efe7990db632bc62184f5ef8553ea47deda3531ba55d80e50537fd6b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportRhrDenied", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportRhrDenied", "text": "{store} did not grant resting heart rate. Nothing was read.", "sha256": "738475416e4f88e266d4bbb4fd923e51641236393710be166a78ed0228f7a9ca", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportRhrNothingUsable", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportRhrNothingUsable", "text": "Nothing usable came back. A store with no resting heart rate in it, or too few days to describe a range, cannot become a baseline.", "sha256": "7100688feaaa48f3df415a2e8b01d0309e90693884a8903123ce958fe696da8d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportRhrSeeded", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportRhrSeeded", "text": "{n, plural, one{1 day folded into a shadow baseline. No day was added to any chart.} other{{n} days folded into a shadow baseline. No day was added to any chart.}}", "sha256": "5ae332f063d2dd680010b7aac8023c021387b49ecb1be651dc5a12f6eb942f31", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportMeasurementsDenied", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportMeasurementsDenied", "text": "{store} did not grant those readings. Nothing was read.", "sha256": "b6f58c0e3475949255ed7ab7ecfcf9303659b4984f384c7dd1ccab130db7c55b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportNothingCameBack", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportNothingCameBack", "text": "Nothing came back. {store} holds no readings of these kinds, or none inside the window it will share.", "sha256": "98160b9ca5c4ba8dce869dd9374009637cc25781ea6e2f811def582b0d4f9109", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:phoneImportReadingsStored", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "phoneImportReadingsStored", "text": "{n, plural, one{1 reading stored, each with the app that recorded it.} other{{n} readings stored, each with the app that recorded it.}}", "sha256": "9ef9940c883ab7f2eaf74aee8fab2117d486ee92367ad3fc59f6939c6a675230", "kind": "arb"}
